        Data2: 1270390942
        Data3: 1777729721
        Data4: -796082448
      Path: event:/Tutorial/Slush/Voiceline_Slush_09
    SubtitleText: But I assure you it's also delicious, you'll see.
    ActionsAfterDialogue:
      LockFeatures: 0
      UnlockFeatures: 0
      DisplayArrows: 0
      RaiseEvent: {fileID: 0}
      AddTasks: []
    DelayBeforeNextSubStep: 0.5
  - ActionsBeforeDialogue:
